data: {"answer": "這裡有防波堤系統，包含防火牆、入侵偵測與防禦（IDS/IPS）。\n你可以看到網段隔離的防護措施。\n這展示了縱深防禦的概念，單靠防火牆不夠用。\n小燈塔代表入侵偵測，有狀況會亮起來。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "防火牆是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Firewall do?", "zh": "防火牆是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.54, "total_s": 7.55}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "breakwater", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "breakwater"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.6}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "breakwater", "label": "Room", "en": "Breakwater", "zh": "防波堤"}, {"key": "firewall", "label": "System", "en": "Firewall", "zh": "防火牆"}, {"key": "ids", "label": "System", "en": "Intrusion Detection & Prevention (IDS/IPS)", "zh": "入侵偵測與防禦（IDS/IPS）"}, {"key": "segmentation", "label": "Control", "en": "Network Segmentation", "zh": "網段隔離"}, {"key": "firewall_ids", "label": "Control", "en": "Firewall & Intrusion Detection", "zh": "防火牆與入侵偵測"}, {"key": "c_defense_in_depth", "label": "Concept", "en": "Defense in Depth", "zh": "縱深防禦"}], "edges": [{"a": "firewall", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "ids", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "firewall_ids"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "segmentation"}, {"a": "segmentation", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "firewall_ids", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "breakwater"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：防波堤・網路邊界\n這裡講的是：防波堤擋住外面的浪，就像防火牆；小燈塔像入侵偵測，有狀況就亮起來。\n重點：縱深防禦：只有防火牆不夠。\n這裡的系統：防火牆、入侵偵測與防禦（IDS/IPS）\n看得到的防護措施：網段隔離、防火牆與入侵偵測\n課程概念：縱深防禦\n可以走到：蒸汽船甲板・行動辦公、港口廣場・供應商", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.53, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 636, "prompt_s": 2.63, "gen_tokens": 62, "gen_s": 4.89, "tok_per_s": 12.7, "first_token_s": 2.65}}, "state": {}}

